{"title":"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The cost to buy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> F-MAT calculators is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f3493ed3e65fc639c760d4739aa3fb72ee444fff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" />. The cost to buy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> F-MAT calculators is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/a/d3aa3a935af66e2d9abe624a9c6040c4f5d22828.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\$15 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\$45 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\$60 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\$75 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\$120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"488\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the price for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> F-MAT calculators is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f3493ed3e65fc639c760d4739aa3fb72ee444fff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" />, each F-Mat calculator must cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/a/8ba70f61b1c146935b89c7ae17eb6cd4ca444773.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> F-MAT calculators must cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/d/ced7c8a931a2fa2821d5ff97bde85c29fcc531b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$15 \\times 4 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } \\$60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"158\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> F-MAT calculators is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times as many as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> F-MAT calculators, so it must cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times as much as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> F-MAT calculators. Thus, the cost to buy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> F-MAT calculators is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/e/7de2f08a3a145432711ba668a7212d55e9a8ad03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$30 \\times 2 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } \\$60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"158\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat\">2026 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2026 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index